Description: Fan speed for the Samsung Galaxy Book 5 (DKMS module)
 Samsung's fan status method (_FST) is broken on Linux, so the stock acpi-fan
 driver can't read the fan. galaxybook_fan is a small DKMS hwmon module that
 reads the same EC field and applies the firmware's own table. Its config is
 made by DKMS from this laptop's DSDT before every build. Galaxy Book 5 only.
 .
 Command: galaxybook-fan status | check | rebuild | test-native
